WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.800
The compact product editor keeps the essential work close together.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:11.700
Edit one content language and preview the same rich product text.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:17.800
Order a product gallery visually and inspect the selected media.

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:23.700
The same native gallery reaches the customer product page.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:29.800
SEO fields use product text and language inheritance as defaults.

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:35.700
The preview shows the effective title, URL and description.

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:41.800
Keep selected recommendations visible while searching the catalogue.

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:47.700
Set their order; the shop checks channel access and availability.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:53.800
Related products use native pictures, contextual prices and product links.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:59.700
Unavailable products stay out of the displayed recommendations.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:05.800
Drag graphical elements to the preview and rearrange sections.

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:11.700
Arrows, deletion, undo and private drafts remain in the same editor.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:17.800
Reopen saved fictional customers and inspect their native steps.

00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:23.700
A budget refusal and a completed simulated purchase remain visible.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:29.700
Explore the current product and try the connected workflows.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.700
Read the handbook, open a private workspace, and review your changes.
